   {
    "text": "Executive Summary",
    "style": "Heading 1",
    "level": 1,
    "marker": null,
    "list_level": null
   },
   {
    "text": "Harrow & Vane cut its direct emissions by twelve percent in fiscal 2025, the third consecutive year of reduction. This report sets out what changed, what it cost and what comes next.",
    "style": "Normal",
    "level": null,
    "marker": null,
    "list_level": null
   },
   {
    "text": "Three programs produced most of the reduction:",
    "style": "Normal",
    "level": null,
    "marker": null,
    "list_level": null
   },
   {
    "text": "Replacing diesel vans in six urban depots with electric vehicles",
    "style": "List Paragraph",
    "level": null,
    "marker": "",
    "list_level": 1
   },
   {
    "text": "Installing rooftop solar at the Tilbury and Hull warehouses",
    "style": "List Paragraph",
    "level": null,
    "marker": "",
    "list_level": 1
   },
   {
    "text": "Rerouting night freight to reduce empty running",
    "style": "List Paragraph",
    "level": null,
    "marker": "",
    "list_level": 1
   },
   {
    "text": "Emissions Performance",
    "style": "Heading 1",
    "level": 1,
    "marker": null,
    "list_level": null
   },
   {
    "text": "Direct Emissions",
    "style": "Heading 2",
    "level": 2,
    "marker": null,
    "list_level": null
   },
   {
    "text": "Direct emissions fell from 48,200 tonnes to 42,400 tonnes of carbon dioxide equivalent. Fleet electrification accounted for roughly two thirds of the fall.",
    "style": "Normal",
    "level": null,
    "marker": null,
    "list_level": null
   },
   {
    "text": "/",
    "style": "Normal",
    "level": null,
    "marker": null,
    "list_level": null
   },
   {
    "text": "The chart above shows the direct emissions recorded in each of the last three fiscal years.",
    "style": "Normal",
    "level": null,
    "marker": null,
    "list_level": null
   },
   {
